# Vite loads this file automatically (`web/.env`, `web/.env.local`, …). Only keys
# prefixed `VITE_` are exposed to client code via `import.meta.env`.
#
# Every var here is OPTIONAL — the app runs with none of them set.

# Which data source the UI reads (`web/src/data/index.ts`).
#   unset / anything else → the real Hono API (`./http.ts`) — the default
#   fixture              → the in-memory fixture (`./fixture.ts`), the offline
#                          path the `web/scripts/` screenshot runs use
# VITE_DATA_SOURCE=fixture
